WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.469
Video sixteen. The Stock Summary and the
outstanding bills.

00:00:04.769 --> 00:00:10.388
Press S on the Gateway. The Stock Summary shows each
stock group with its quantity, rate and value.

00:00:10.508 --> 00:00:16.127
Enter opens a group. Silk Fabric shows
(-)30.00 Mtr. You sold more than the stock.

00:00:16.157 --> 00:00:21.175
Enter on the item shows each month. In
October, 180 Mtr went out.

00:00:21.876 --> 00:00:26.361
Enter on the month shows the voucher: sales
invoice five to Joshi Stores.

00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:30.529
150 Mtr were in stock.

00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:33.609
The invoice sold 180 Mtr.

00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:38.624
So the books show (-)30 Mtr. Count the stock,
or enter the missing purchase.

00:00:38.924 --> 00:00:44.074
Press Alt+G and type bills. The Go To list
shows Bills Receivable and Bills Payable.

00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:48.854
Each open bill shows the party, the amount,
the due date and the days overdue.

00:00:49.231 --> 00:00:53.514
F6 turns on the ageing. Two bills are older
than 90 days.

00:00:54.214 --> 00:01:01.097
Enter on a bill shows all the bills of that
party. Sharma Traders must pay ₹75,392.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:08.678
Esc, then F5 changes to Bills Payable: the bills that
you must pay. Bill MF/312 is 61 days overdue.

00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:12.708
The same ageing as a picture. Most of the
money is new.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:18.790
₹81,810 is older than 90 days. Call these
parties first.

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:22.540
Next video: print, Excel and PDF.

